{
  "slug": "future-video-studio",
  "name": "Future Video Studio",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Future Video Studio lets Claude create cinematic AI videos through the hosted FVS MCP server. It can turn creative briefs, scripts, shot lists, and public reference assets into finished video renders, then monitor progress and return the final video URL.\n\nThe plugin supports both FVS account renders through an Agent API key and no-account pay-as-you-go renders through Link payment quotes, so users can either spend existing wallet credits or approve a one-off render payment before generation begins.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install future-video-studio@claude-community` from `ariadne-coil/future-video-render-claude-plugin`.\n\nMarketplace-compatible Claude plugin package for Future Video Studio.\n\nFuture Video Studio lets Claude create cinematic AI videos through the hosted FVS MCP server. It can turn creative briefs, scripts, shot lists, and public reference assets into finished video renders, then monitor progress and return the final video URL.\n\nThe plugin supports both FVS account renders through an Agent API key and no-account pay-as-you-go renders through Link payment quotes, so users can either spend existing wallet credits or approve a one-off render payment before generation begins.",
